---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - CryptoNav">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100 mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-surface-400 mb-8">Last updated: August 27, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6">
      <p class="text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        Welcome to CryptoNav. These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of cryptonav.site. By using the site, you agree to be bound by these Terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">1. Informational Use Only — Not Financial Advice</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        CryptoNav is a directory and navigation service. All content, listings, prices, and rankings are provided for informational purposes only and do <strong>not</strong> constitute investment, financial, legal, or tax advice. Crypto assets are highly volatile and you may lose all of your funds. Always do your own research (DYOR) and consult a qualified professional before making any decision.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">2. No Warranties & Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        The site is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, or timeliness of any listing or data, and we are not liable for any loss arising from your use of, or reliance on, the site. Listed projects are not endorsed or vetted for safety unless explicitly labeled.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">3. Listings & Submissions</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        Project submissions are reviewed at our discretion. We may accept, reject, edit, or remove any listing at any time, with or without notice. Inclusion does not imply partnership, endorsement, or verification of a project's legitimacy.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">4. Advertising & Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        CryptoNav may display sponsored placements and affiliate links. We may receive compensation when you click an affiliate link or engage with a sponsor. Compensation does not influence editorial listings or rankings. Sponsored content will be identified as such where practical.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">5. Third-Party Sites</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        The site contains links to external websites we do not operate or control. We are not responsible for their content, practices, or availability. Your interactions with third-party sites are governed by their own terms and policies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">6. Prohibited Uses</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        You agree not to misuse the site, attempt to disrupt its operation, scrape it at scale in violation of applicable law, or use it for any unlawful purpose.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">7. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        We may revise these Terms at any time. Continued use of the site after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">8. Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
        Questions about these Terms? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@cryptonav.com" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">hello@cryptonav.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
